        "number": 17,
        "title": "Feature/authentication",
        "body": "## Description\r\n\r\nThis pull request implements JWT-based authentication and improves session security.\r\n\r\n### Changes\r\n\r\n* Added JWT authentication for user login and authorization.\r\n* Implemented persistent JWT authentication to maintain user sessions securely.\r\n* Added secure logout functionality to properly clear authentication data and invalidate the user session.\r\n* Improved authentication flow and security handling across the application.\r\n\r\n### Testing\r\n\r\n* Tested user login and JWT generation.\r\n* Verified authenticated access using JWT tokens.\r\n* Tested persistent authentication behavior.\r\n* Verified that logout properly clears the user session and prevents further authenticated requests.\r\n",
